
---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Philosophy | Causeway"
  description="The Causeway philosophy: understand the problem, bring perspectives together, and make better decisions."
>
  <section class="philosophy-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">What Guides the Work</p>
      <h1>Better decisions<br />begin with better understanding.</h1>
      <p>
        Meaningful improvement starts by taking the time to understand
        what is really happening, what matters, and who needs to be part
        of the conversation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="philosophy-intro section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="intro-grid">
        <div class="intro-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">The Causeway Philosophy</p>
          <h2>Before finding the way forward, we need to understand where we are.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="intro-copy">
          <p>
            Organizations are filled with smart people, good intentions,
            and a desire to make things better.
          </p>
          <p>
            Yet many still struggle to create lasting change because they move to solutions without fully understanding the problem.
          </p>
          <p class="emphasis">
            I believe improvement begins with having a better understanding.
          </p>
          <p>
            My work helps organizations slow down enough to engage the
            people closest to the work, ask better questions, understand
            what is truly driving the challenge, use evidence to create
            clarity, and make decisions with confidence.
          </p>
          <blockquote>
            Even the best solution cannot succeed if we never truly
            understood the problem.
          </blockquote>
          <p>
            The goal goes beyond simply solving today's challenges.
            It is to help organizations build the confidence, capability,
            and culture to make better decisions long after an engagement ends.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="philosophy-image">
        <img
          src="/causeway-philosophy-top.png"
          alt="A diverse group of colleagues collaborating, with a woman speaking and a man listening attentively."
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission">
    <div class="mission-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our Mission</p>
      <p class="mission-statement">
        Improve the quality of organizational decisions through
        thoughtful stakeholder engagement, evidence-informed thinking,
        and disciplined discovery.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pillars section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Three Pillars</p>
        <h2>How the work takes shape.</h2>
        <p>
          A thoughtful process, focused on meaningful progress
          and lasting impact.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-grid">
        <article class="pillar">
          <span class="pillar-number">01</span>
          <h3>Intentional</h3>
          <p class="pillar-tagline">Understand before we act.</p>
          <p>
            Together, we work to uncover the right problem before
            designing the solution.
          </p>
          <p>
            I create space for discovery, curiosity, and open dialogue
            to understand what is truly happening, not just what
            appears on the surface.
          </p>
          <p class="pillar-highlight">
            Ask the right people the right questions before finding
            the right answer.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="pillar">
          <span class="pillar-number">02</span>
          <h3>Impactful</h3>
          <p class="pillar-tagline">Focus on what creates change.</p>
          <p>
            I work alongside organizations to prioritize improvements
            that positively affect outcomes for people, teams,
            organizations, and systems.
          </p>
          <p>
            Through evidence-informed thinking and stakeholder
            engagement, I help focus energy where it matters most.
          </p>
          <p class="pillar-highlight">
            Better decisions lead to better outcomes.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="pillar">
          <span class="pillar-number">03</span>
          <h3>Sustainable</h3>
          <p class="pillar-tagline">Build capacity, not dependency.</p>
          <p>
            The goal is not to create reliance on external expertise.
          </p>
          <p>
            I help organizations develop the confidence, capability,
            and culture to continue solving complex challenges long
            after an engagement ends.
          </p>
          <p class="pillar-highlight">
            The best measure of success is when organizations
            no longer need me.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="values section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Core Values</p>
        <h2>What matters in how I work.</h2>
        <p>
          Better decisions depend not only on what we do,
          but on how we work together.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <article class="value">
          <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
              <path d="M6 9h25a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H17l-8 6v-6H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V13a4 4 0 0 1 4-4Z"/>
              <path d="M17 17h11M17 23h7"/>
              <path d="M35 19h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v12l-6-4h-3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Every voice matters</h3>
          <p>
            The people closest to the work have essential insights.
            Better decisions come from including the perspectives
            of those who deliver, receive, and experience services
            and systems every day.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="value">
          <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
              <path d="M5 11h16a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v10a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-7l-6 5v-5H5a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V15a4 4 0 0 1 4-4Z"/>
              <path d="M27 18h16a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v10a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-2v5l-7-5h-3"/>
              <path d="M25 29s-7-4.4-7-8.4a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 7-2.1 3.8 3.8 0 0 1 7 2.1c0 4-7 8.4-7 8.4Z" fill="#668A9A" stroke="#668A9A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Psychological safety enables better decisions</h3>
          <p>
            People contribute their best thinking when they feel
            respected, included, and safe to challenge assumptions,
            express different perspectives, and speak openly.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="value">
          <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="12"/>
              <path d="m29 29 11 11M14 25v-6M20 25V14M26 25v-9"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Evidence creates clarity</h3>
          <p>
            Data and evidence create shared understanding. They help
            organizations learn, improve, and make decisions based
            on what is known rather than assumptions.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="value">
          <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
              <path d="m13 12 22 4M13 12l3 24M35 16l-19 20M35 16l-3 22M16 36l16 2"/>
              <circle cx="13" cy="12" r="5"/>
              <circle cx="35" cy="16" r="5"/>
              <circle cx="16" cy="36" r="5"/>
              <circle cx="32" cy="38" r="5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Systems over symptoms</h3>
          <p>
            I look beyond what is visible and seek to understand
            the conditions, relationships, and structures that
            create challenges.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="value">
          <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
              <path d="M6 41h36"/>
              <path d="M10 41V29h8v12M21 41V21h8v20M32 41V13h8v28"/>
              <path d="m10 22 11-9 8 2L40 4"/>
              <path d="M31 4h9v9"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Build capacity, not dependency</h3>
          <p>
            My goal is to leave organizations stronger, more
            confident, and better equipped to understand and
            solve future challenges.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    /* HERO */

    .philosophy-hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 570px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(
        115deg,
        #23364A 0%,
        #304B60 60%,
        #668A9A 100%
      );
      color: #F5F2EA;
    }

    .philosophy-hero .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      width: 86%;
      max-width: 1450px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 100px 0;
    }

    /* SECTION LABELS */

    .philosophy-hero .eyebrow,
    .philosophy-intro .eyebrow,
    .mission .eyebrow,
    .pillars .eyebrow,
    .values .eyebrow {
      display: block;
      font-size: 18px !important;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em !important;
      line-height: 1.5;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .philosophy-hero .eyebrow,
    .mission .eyebrow {
      color: #C2BBA8;
    }

    .philosophy-intro .eyebrow,
    .pillars .eyebrow,
    .values .eyebrow {
      color: #668A9A;
    }

    .philosophy-hero h1 {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 20px 0 25px;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 72px);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.12;
    }

    .philosophy-hero .hero-content > p:last-child {
      max-width: 620px;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #F5F2EA;
    }

    /* PHILOSOPHY INTRO */

    .philosophy-intro.section {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: none !important;
      padding: 110px 0 !important;
      margin: 0;
      background: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .philosophy-intro .section-inner {
      width: 92% !important;
      max-width: 1500px !important;
      margin: 0 auto !important;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .intro-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
      gap: clamp(50px, 7vw, 110px);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .intro-heading h2 {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 49px);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 20px 0 0;
    }

    .intro-copy {
      min-width: 0;
      max-width: 850px;
    }

    .intro-copy p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }

    .intro-copy .emphasis {
      color: var(--coastal);
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 27px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 35px 0;
    }

    .intro-copy blockquote {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--coastal);
      padding: 8px 0 8px 28px;
      margin: 38px 0;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 25px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--slate);
    }

    /* PHILOSOPHY IMAGE */

    .philosophy-image {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 75px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .philosophy-image img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 440px;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center 45%;
    }

    /* MISSION */

    .mission {
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 95px 7%;
      background: #23364A;
      color: #F5F2EA;
      border: none;
    }

    .mission-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .mission-statement {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 25px 0 0;
      color: #F5F2EA !important;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: clamp(29px, 4vw, 46px);
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* THREE PILLARS */

    .pillars.section {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: none;
      padding: 110px 0 !important;
      margin: 0;
      background: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .pillars .section-inner {
      width: 88%;
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-bottom: 65px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 46px);
      font-weight: 400;
      margin: 18px 0;
    }

    .section-heading > p:last-child {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .pillar-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 45px;
    }

    .pillar {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
      padding-top: 28px;
    }

    .pillar-number {
      display: block;
      color: var(--coastal);
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 48px;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .pillar h3,
    .value h3 {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .pillar-tagline {
      color: var(--coastal);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 28px !important;
    }

    .pillar p,
    .value p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
    }

    .pillar .pillar-highlight {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
      padding-top: 22px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* CORE VALUES */

    .values.section {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: none;
      padding: 105px 0 110px !important;
      margin: 0;
      background: #F5F2EA;
    }

    .values .section-inner {
      width: 88%;
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .values-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
      column-gap: 45px;
      row-gap: 55px;
    }

    .value {
      grid-column: span 2;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--stone);
      padding-top: 28px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Centre the final two values on the second row */

    .value:nth-child(4) {
      grid-column: 2 / span 2;
    }

    .value:nth-child(5) {
      grid-column: 4 / span 2;
    }

    /* VALUE ICONS */

    .value-icon {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      color: #668A9A;
    }

    .value-icon svg {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      stroke: currentColor;
      stroke-width: 2;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .value h3 {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    /* TABLET */

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .philosophy-hero {
        min-height: 500px;
      }

      .philosophy-intro.section {
        padding: 75px 0 !important;
      }

      .philosophy-intro .section-inner {
        width: 88% !important;
      }

      .intro-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 35px;
      }

      .philosophy-image {
        margin-top: 50px;
      }

      .philosophy-image img {
        height: 350px;
      }

      .pillar-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 50px;
      }

      .values-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        column-gap: 40px;
      }

      .value,
      .value:nth-child(4),
      .value:nth-child(5) {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .value:nth-child(5) {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        width: calc(50% - 20px);
        justify-self: center;
      }

      .pillars.section,
      .values.section {
        padding-top: 75px !important;
        padding-bottom: 75px !important;
      }
    }

    /* MOBILE */

    @media (max-width: 550px) {
      .philosophy-hero {
        min-height: 480px;
      }

      .philosophy-hero .hero-content {
        width: 88%;
      }

      .philosophy-hero .hero-content > p:last-child {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .philosophy-intro .section-inner,
      .pillars .section-inner,
      .values .section-inner {
        width: 88% !important;
      }

      .philosophy-image {
        margin-top: 35px;
      }

      .philosophy-image img {
        height: 250px;
      }

      .values-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        row-gap: 38px;
      }

      .value,
      .value:nth-child(4),
      .value:nth-child(5) {
        grid-column: 1;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .mission {
        padding: 70px 7%;
      }

      .intro-heading h2 {
        font-size: 34px;
      }

      .philosophy-hero .eyebrow,
      .philosophy-intro .eyebrow,
      .mission .eyebrow,
      .pillars .eyebrow,
      .values .eyebrow {
        font-size: 16px !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
